Roomtone original application
----------------------------
Source: https://github.com/madebysourasith-sudo/roomtone/
Revision: cdcd63662c4aebb70857ba0d5e0552c73e38eb0f
Author: madebysourasith-sudo

src/original/roomtone.js, src/original/roomtone.css and
src/original/markup.html are adapted from the original application at the
user's request. The original interface, models, scene settings and behavior
are retained. Modifications integrate Next.js and Three.js r187, self-host
dependencies, cache/batch geometry, schedule rendering and reuse shadows.
Upstream did not provide a general license; no license or ownership claim
is added to upstream code. This repository's MIT license applies only to
the independently authored integration and optimization code.

