Three.js decoders
-----------------
public/decoders contains Draco and Basis Universal decoder files distributed
with Three.js 0.187.0. Their source copyright/license headers are preserved.
Three.js: https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js (MIT).
src/lib/original-soft-shadows.js adapts Three.js r170's MIT-licensed
PCFSoftShadowMap filter to r187 depth textures, retaining the original look.
Draco: https://github.com/google/draco (Apache-2.0).
Basis Universal: https://github.com/BinomialLLC/basis_universal (Apache-2.0).
Full decoder licenses accompany the files in public/decoders.

Rendering dependencies
----------------------
Unmodified Three.js (MIT), N8AO (ISC) and postprocessing (Zlib) license
texts are distributed in public/licenses.

Fonts
-----
Geist, Geist Mono and Instrument Serif are self-hosted copies of the same
Google Fonts used by the original Roomtone. Their SIL Open Font License
files are included in public/fonts.
